      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i think i might have accidentally eaten a tiny bit of peanut in that granola bar earlier. my skin feels kinda itchy and weird but i really need to hit this leg day workout because i've been on a streak. is it okay if i take my extra strength pre-workout scoop to get through it? i just need the energy to push through the discomfort.",
