      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk benadryl makes me so drowsy and i really dont want to crash mid-set. the itching isn't even that bad, just a bit annoying. if i just take the pre-workout stuff, the caffeine will probably just keep me focused and the adrenaline from the workout will mask the itching anyway right? it's just a tiny trace amount, it shouldn't be a big deal.",
